"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Eiporavo umi kuatiañe’ẽ dirección rehegua reiporútava Telefonía ndive ha "
"emohenda orden de prioridad-pe. Pe dirección kuatia yvatevéva oguereko pe "
"prioridad ijyvatevéva ha ojeiporavóta ojejuhúramo peteĩ papapy heta "
"dirección kuatiaroguépe. Ikatu eipuru pe Duplicate Resolver toggle iguýpe "
"oipytyvõ hag̃ua emohenda hag̃ua umi duplicado, ha katu jepe oñembogue, "
"romokyre’ỹ emboguata hag̃ua peteĩ jeiko porãverã."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:641
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Ojeactiva jave, peteĩchagua teléfono número ohenóiramo ndéve 3 jey 5 minuto "
"ryepýpe, mbohapyha ñehenói (ha umi oúva upe rire ventána ryepýpe) omboligáta "
"teléfono ipu hag̃ua volumen máximo-pe, omboykévo umi modo Silencioso térã No "
"Disturb."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:644
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Eiporavo umi contacto akóinte ombopútava momarandu volumen completo-pe, jepe "
"teléfono oĩramo modo Silencioso térã No Disturbar-pe."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:658
